.vs/
*.user
*.tmp
Thumbs.db

# Release packages are published as GitHub Release assets, not committed here.
# Committed archives stay in git history forever and make every clone heavier,
# so build the zip locally and attach it to the release instead:
#   gh release create v<version> --title "LogFinder_<version>" --notes-file RELEASE_NOTES_<version>.md <zip>
# (LogFinder_v2.6.0.327.zip and LogFinder_v2.6.0.328.zip predate this rule and are
#  still tracked, because those versions have no release asset - the committed
#  archives are the only public download for them.)
*.zip
